[00:01.00] 作曲 : Thomaz, Cameron Jibril
[00:06.86]Yeah, I, I know it's hard to remember
{"是的　我　我知道这很难记起"}
[00:09.78]The people we used to be
{"我们曾经的模样"}
[00:11.69]It's even harder to picture
{"要想象出来就更难了"}
[00:13.58]That you're not here next to me
{"你不在我身旁"}
[00:15.41]You say it's too late to make it
{"你说为时已晚"}
[00:17.28]But is it too late to try?
{"但尝试是否已迟？"}
[00:19.13]And in our time that you wasted
{"在你挥霍的时光里"}
[00:20.78]All of our bridges burned down
{"我们所有的桥梁都已焚毁"}
[00:23.02]I've wasted my nights
{"我虚度了长夜"}
[00:24.82]You turned out the lights
{"你熄灭了灯火"}
[00:26.65]Now i'm paralyzed
{"如今我动弹不得"}
[00:28.63]Still stucked in that time when we called it love
{"仍困在那段我们称之为爱的时光"}
[00:32.36]But even the sun sets in paradise
{"但即便天堂也有日落"}
[00:36.59]I'm at a payphone trying to call home
{"我在付费电话旁试图拨通家的方向"}
[00:40.28]All of my change I spent on you
{"我所有的零钱都花在了你身上"}
[00:44.21]Where have the times gone
{"那些时光去了何方"}
[00:45.94]Baby It's all wrong, where are the plans we made for two?
{"亲爱的　全都错了　我们为彼此规划的未来呢？"}
[00:51.36]If happy ever after did exist
{"如果幸福结局真的存在"}
[00:55.02]I would still be holding you like this
{"我依然会这样拥抱着你"}
[00:58.94]And all those fairytales are full of bullshit
{"而所有童话都充满谎言"}
[01:02.73]One more ****ing love song, I'll be sick
{"再多一首该死的爱情歌曲　我就要吐了"}
[01:06.37]Oh
[01:07.21]
[01:07.95]You turned your back on tomorrow
